====== Linksys E8450 (aka. Belkin RT3200) ======

The Linksys E8450 is a dual-band 4x4 IEEE 802.11n/ax router based on MediaTek MT7622BV for 2.4 GHz and MediaTek MT7915E (Filogic 615) for 5 GHz. It has five Gigabit Ethernet ports, one USB 2.0 port, 128 MiB SPI-NAND Flash (2k+64) and 512 MB DDR3 RAM.

